  m_Name: LuckTable
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: HollowSeven.Runtime::HollowSeven.LuckTable
  entries:
  - value: 3
    tag: 1
    delta: 1
    codexBlurb: 'Third time lucky: a lucky number in many folk traditions.'
  - value: 7
    tag: 1
    delta: 1
    codexBlurb: Lucky in Western traditions and the classic slot-machine symbol.
  - value: 8
    tag: 1
    delta: 1
    codexBlurb: In Chinese, its sound resembles the word for prosperity.
  - value: 9
    tag: 1
    delta: 1
    codexBlurb: In Chinese, its sound resembles the word for long-lasting.
  - value: 77
    tag: 2
    delta: 2
    codexBlurb: 'Double sevens: fortune twice over.'
  - value: 88
    tag: 2
    delta: 2
    codexBlurb: Double prosperity in Chinese numerology.
  - value: 108
    tag: 3
    delta: 3
    codexBlurb: Sacred in Hinduism and Buddhism; prayer strings commonly have 108 beads.
  - value: 777
    tag: 3
    delta: 3
    codexBlurb: The classic slot-machine jackpot.
  - value: 786
    tag: 3
    delta: 3
    codexBlurb: In South Asian Islamic numerology, associated with the opening words of the Bismillah.
  - value: 888
    tag: 3
    delta: 3
    codexBlurb: Triple prosperity in Chinese numerology.
  - value: 4
    tag: 4
    delta: -1
    codexBlurb: In parts of East Asia, its sound resembles the word for death.
  - value: 13
    tag: 4
    delta: -1
    codexBlurb: 'Triskaidekaphobia: unlucky in many Western traditions.'
  - value: 17
    tag: 4
    delta: -1
    codexBlurb: 'In Italy, XVII rearranges to VIXI: I have lived.'
  - value: 49
    tag: 4
    delta: -1
    codexBlurb: In Japanese, 4 and 9 can be read as to suffer.
  - value: 666
    tag: 5
    delta: -3
    codexBlurb: In Christian tradition, linked with the Number of the Beast.
